# Orbit Orchestra — environment variables
#
# This game is fully client-side. It needs NO API keys, NO network calls,
# and NO backend to run. All audio is synthesized in-browser via the Web Audio API.
#
# The variables below are OPTIONAL and only affect the analytics hook in
# src/utils/analytics.ts. If unset, analytics is a no-op. No secrets are
# required and none should ever be committed.

# Optional: Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (G-XXXXXXXXXX). If unset, no
# GA4 script is loaded and no analytics events are sent.
# VITE_GA4_ID=

# Optional: override the localStorage key prefix used to persist settings and
# progress. Defaults to "orbit-orchestra".
# VITE_STORAGE_PREFIX=orbit-orchestra
